# A server without MOVE: copy, mark only those uids deleted, expunge only
# them (RFC 4315 UID EXPUNGE). Hand-written (see login_list.imap)
S: * OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 UIDPLUS] IMAP4 service ready
C: a1 LOGIN "someone@example.com" "app-pass"
S: a1 OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 UIDPLUS] user logged in
C: a2 SELECT "INBOX"
S: * 3 EXISTS
S: a2 OK [READ-WRITE] SELECT completed
C: a3 UID COPY 7 "Deleted Messages"
S: a3 OK [COPYUID 1700000001 7 301] COPY completed
C: a4 UID STORE 7 +FLAGS.SILENT (\Deleted)
S: a4 OK STORE completed
C: a5 UID EXPUNGE 7
S: * 1 EXPUNGE
S: a5 OK EXPUNGE completed
C: a6 LOGOUT
S: * BYE logging out
S: a6 OK LOGOUT completed
